}
	
</style></head><body><article id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80bf-b5d3-f41575f52b4e" class="page sans"><header><div class="page-header-icon undefined"><img class="icon notion-static-icon" src="https://www.notion.so/icons/robot_yellow.svg"/></div><h1 class="page-title">Roteiro para chatbot (carreira)</h1><p class="page-description"></p></header><div class="page-body"><figure class="block-color-gray_background callout" style="white-space:pre-wrap;display:flex" id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8003-8d6a-eafc31990b49"><div style="font-size:1.5em"><span class="icon">💡</span></div><div style="width:100%"><p id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80c1-bd3e-c53a4f03cf46" class="">Segue o roteiro detalhado em formato Markdown, pronto para você copiar e colar no seu Notion ou outra ferramenta de organização. Inclui links clicáveis e checklists semanais para você acompanhar o progresso da sua transição ao mercado de chatbots e IA conversacional.</p></div></figure><hr id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8045-8afe-e9bae423e0e6"/><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80f1-8a0f-ca00a50e1ac7" class="">Semana 1 – Fundamentos de NLP</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-802f-9a34-d5a7341fe197" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Fazer curso: <a href="https://www.coursera.org/learn/classification-vector-spaces-in-nlp">Natural Language Processing with Classification and Vector Spaces (Coursera)</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80f8-919d-c5211e71b634" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Ler: <a href="https://huggingface.co/learn/nlp-course/chapter1">Introduction to NLP — Hugging Face</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80c4-88f2-cb0badbf6812" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Estudar conceitos: <em>token</em>, <em>intent</em>, <em>entity</em>, <em>slot filling</em></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80ca-a168-e98cacf94a49" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Mapear fluxos de conversa com <a href="https://whimsical.com/">Whimsical</a> (ex: onboarding técnico)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80fd-8615-fab99150d604" class="">Semana 2 – Design de Conversações</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8038-aa80-ecc680e21acc" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Curso: <a href="https://www.conversationdesigninstitute.com/">Conversational Design Foundations (Conversation Design Institute)</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8027-8773-c8e3b2a860f7" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Estudar: <a href="https://cloud.google.com/dialogflow/docs">Dialogflow CX Documentation</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8076-b7f7-dc579d0411ac" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Definir persona, tom de voz e objetivos do chatbot</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8028-a998-ec6ab2c2e23a" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Criar documento com exemplos de boas e más respostas (Google Docs)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-808d-9770-ffd4f5d21204" class="">Semana 3 – Construindo seu primeiro chatbot (Low-code)</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8071-be60-c77dcb00be45" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Explorar: <a href="https://cloud.google.com/dialogflow/cx/">Dialogflow CX</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80e7-a00e-d5df0d918425" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Seguir tutorial: <a href="https://cloud.google.com/dialogflow/es/docs/quickstart-es">Dialogflow Quickstart</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8030-a7c4-e98d027d1e43" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Criar chatbot FAQ simples</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80e3-8278-cb08177bcdca" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Integrar chatbot ao Telegram (exemplo: <a href="https://www.twilio.com/blog/dialogflow-telegram-chatbot-python">Dialogflow Telegram Integration</a>)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8047-89f7-ecc06e4ab109" class="">Semana 4 – Métricas e Gestão de Conversas</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8078-94d6-d880ba01b8c7" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Assitir vídeo: <em>Google Cloud Conversational Analytics</em> (YouTube)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8082-95c7-e9df4be67ed6" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Implementar logs e coletar métricas (intents acionadas, erros)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8014-b479-f19382b144c7" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Usar Google Sheets + Apps Script para análise das métricas</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80bc-a860-dccf100ff2d1" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Criar relatório de insights para melhorar o bot</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-800f-946e-d26903a613f6" class="">Semana 5 – APIs e Arquitetura de Bots</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8045-b51b-cd42003f8045" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Curso: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7t2alSnE2-I">FastAPI Crash Course (YouTube)</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-801c-90d8-c0c92fa4fa9e" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Usar <a href="https://www.postman.com/">Postman</a> para testar APIs</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8038-b31c-f40ac99b6cf8" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Criar webhook em Python com FastAPI para receber mensagens e responder</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8024-b937-f64a71f095fe" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Documentar o projeto no GitHub (README técnico)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80b2-9a7e-fc6aef2ef566" class="">Semana 6 – Integração com OpenAI API</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80d1-a525-df53b5574ddc" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Ler a documentação: <a href="https://platform.openai.com/docs/introduction">OpenAI API Docs</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80ee-a7a5-cf64f8560d5f" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Criar chatbot em Python com OpenAI GPT-4 Turbo API</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-808a-8371-e234894a6f9e" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Usar <a href="https://streamlit.io/">Streamlit</a> para construir interface simples</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-805b-9b49-d781a6002405" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Projeto: Assistente de documentação técnica que responde perguntas baseadas em markdown</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-805f-87a4-e386054829ae" class="">Semana 7 – UX Writing para Conversas</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8045-a19a-f29148e67b33" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Curso: <a href="https://uxcontent.com/course/ux-writing-for-chatbots">UX Writing for Chatbots (UXContent Collective)</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8066-990d-e65018823398" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Ler: <em>Design Better Chatbots</em> (Google UX Writing Library)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8050-9a32-e5a16078b11f" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Criar Voice &amp; Tone Guide no Notion (persona, tom, exemplos de texto)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8028-85d1-df1d1325ae64" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Ajustar mensagens de erro e feedback do chatbot</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80bb-ab70-ca3f7dd489aa" class="">Semana 8 – Conversational Flows Avançados</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8045-95ba-e9ec715d1d0e" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Curso avançado: <em>Dialogflow CX Advanced Design Patterns</em> (Google Cloud)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8008-9b97-faa84fc29c1e" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Implementar context switching e conversation repair</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-802d-aaa9-c8f92af2f187" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Criar bot com múltiplos tópicos (ex.: docs, suporte, atualização de conteúdo)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-806c-b441-da64dac560b0" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Gravar vídeo demonstrativo com Loom</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8027-a80b-e6bb00bfc0ff" class="">Semana 9 – LangChain e LLMs</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80df-a576-cfbe1ae3a99b" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Curso: <a href="https://learnprompting.org/docs/intermediate/langchain">LangChain 101 – Learn Prompting</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8097-813c-d5f8adfddd25" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Usar LangChain e ChromaDB para construir chatbot RAG</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8075-9493-f1195a945b25" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Indexar documentação técnica própria para responder perguntas (FAQ)</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8097-9f62-cad681061729" class="">Semana 10 – Deploy e Integração Real</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80e6-9aed-eed92f583c83" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Fazer deploy do bot no <a href="https://render.com/">Render.com</a> ou <a href="https://huggingface.co/spaces">Hugging Face Spaces</a></span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8047-9ef6-d1fc84b313ca" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Publicar link público do chatbot funcional para testes externos</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8011-8da5-cc288e46751e" class="">Semana 11 – Portfólio e Branding Técnico</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-809c-af4f-fc3616ef565d" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Publicar projetos no GitHub com documentação detalhada</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80b2-b7cc-da068cca4f68" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Criar post no LinkedIn sobre a jornada de aprendizado e novos skills</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-809a-b157-d206aed4be35" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Adicionar projetos a template de portfólio no Notion</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul><h2 id="292c6f7d-f2fd-807e-9435-db98be4c3e8d" class="">Semana 12 – Comunidade e Networking</h2><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-801e-84c5-e24b9176e880" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Entrar em comunidades como:</span><div class="indented"><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80cf-ab6a-c7961b115e83" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://forum.rasa.com/">Rasa Community Forum</a></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8039-8b23-c00779bc2954" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/groups/8256895/">Chatbot Brasil (LinkedIn)</a></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-8096-a60c-e0d42bee4c9d" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://t.me/promptengineeringbrasil">Prompt Engineering Brasil (Telegram)</a></li></ul></div></li></ul><ul id="292c6f7d-f2fd-80ea-bedd-d406adb8fd7e" class="to-do-list"><li><div class="checkbox checkbox-off"></div> <span class="to-do-children-unchecked">Escrever artigo no Medium ou LinkedIn sobre documentação para chatbots</span><div class="indented"></div></li></ul></div></article><span class="sans" style="font-size:14px;padding-top:2em"></span></body></html>